      "type": "library",
      "name": "core.openwop.ai",
      "version": "1.3.2",
      "description": "Spec-canonical AI-call pack. v1.0 (chatCompletion, structuredOutput, toolCalling, embeddings) plus v1.1 multi-modal + LLM helpers — image generate/edit/upscale, audio transcribe/synthesize, video generate, rerank, classify, extract, guardrails, transform. Routes through host BYOK aiProviders. v1.3.1: image-generate output schema now declares the real runtime shape (images[].url + mimeType, never contentBase64) — the host persists each image as a Media asset and returns a serve URL, never raw bytes.",
